  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 207.01 Commencement of Hearing. A hearing shall be commenced by an order of the department giving notice to the parties as required by Ncr 207.02.\n\nSource. #14254, INTERIM, eff 5-23-25; ss by #14447, eff 12-4-25",
